  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Accin en Cortizos del Estado de So Paulo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tenement Action Program in the State of Sao Paulo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to improve the quality of life of poor families living in substandard housing in tenements in the downtown areas of municipalities in the State of Sao Paulo, by financing housing solutions, renovating existing tenements or building new ones, and taking steps to improve that state&apos;s system to finance public housing.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
